<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">Habakuk</book>
  <para style="h">Habakuk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habakuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakuk</para>
  <para style="mt">Habakuk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Guolnei Habakuk in puohgih amu khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Mangpa kei bang tanvei, ahiei ka kikou dinga, “Nang na hing dawn lou ding?” Hiemngamtah a kigumnawna aum hi, chiin na kungah ka hing kikou a, nang na hing hunkhe sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangding a thulimlouna hing musah a, tualeh gentheina hing ensah na hiei? Ka masangah manthaina leh, hiemngapna a um a, tualeh kihauna leh kinielna apiengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin dan in thuneina anei nawn sih a, thudih a vaihawmna a um ngai sih hi. Aziehpen migilouten midihtatte a imkuol uhi; tuaziehin vaihawmna heikawi in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Namte lah en unlen, kaihit un, lamdang sa in chiza un, aziehpen na damsung un nna khat ka sem ding, tuakhu hing kihil nanleh nouten na gingta sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Ngai un, Kaldai mi ka tungding a, nam hel leh gangtah ahi ua, amauh tenna mun hilou, munte lahpieh dingin, leitung vailam tuonsuohin apei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute nam ginhuoi leh chizat um ahi ua, Avaihawmna uleh athupina uh ama ua, kipat mama in apawtdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asakolte uh kamkeite sangin agangzaw ua, nitahlam ngie gilkielte sangin azauhuoi zaw uhi. Asakol tungtuong galkapte uh hattah in ahing tai ua, asakol tung tuongte uh gamlapi akipat in ahing kuon uhi. Sa ne dinga gangtah a bawsuh muvanlai leeng bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thagumsuo dinga hing kuon ngen ahi ua, suolam hui bangin mailam anaw ua, pieunel khopkhawm bang mai in, salte aman khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaun leengte asimmaw ua, vaihawmte anuisan uhi. Kulpi muonhuoi chinteng simmaw in anuisan uhi; aziehpen panmun leipal asepvum ua, khopi ala zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n alungsim akiheng a atakhiel ding a, akhelna abawl ding a asilbawltheina uh khu, Pasian a angai ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />AW MANGPA Ka Pasian, ka Misiengthoupa, Nang kumtawn akipata a umsa hilou na hiei mah? Ka shisih ding uhi. Aw Mangpa nang amaute vaihawmna a dingin na guotta a, Aw Suongpi, Nangman amaute suhdih dingin na phutdohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang khu silgilou en theilou khop a mitchim na hi a, tualeh gitlouna na en nuom sih a, bangding a lepchie tah a gamtate en a, migilouin ama sanga dihtatzawte abawlsiet chienga, bangdinga sip dide a um thei na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangdinga mihingte tuipi a ngate banga na bawl a, atung ua vaihawm ding neilou ganhing, bohvahte banga na bawl ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaun ngakuoi in amaute akhaidoh sieng ua, alen un aman ua, alenvaite un ahuikhawm ua; tuaziehin kipahin nuom asa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin alen uh kung uah akithoi ua, alenvai kung uah gimnamtui ahal ua, tuate ziehin atuohpha ua, neh leh taah kichingtah aneilaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin amauten alen uh aguoh a umsah in, hepina bei a namte, that ngitnget ding ahi ding uoi?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka galvenna ah ka ding dinga, innsawng tung ki-im na dai ah ka tuong dinga, lungkimlou a ka phunna thu ah, Ka kungah bang ahiei ang gen ding, tualeh kei ang mawpai taah leh, bangchi’n ka dawng diei, chi kava ngah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n kei ahing dawngta a: “Mengmuna gielin, asim miin tai kawm a asim thei ding, khop a kichien in suongpeh tungah giel in, ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mengmuna khu hun guotsa sunga, ding maimai ahia, atawp lam ah thu ahing gen dinga, azuou sih ding hi. Zekai deu in sawt deu nanleh, Ngah in, ahing tun ngeingei ding ziehin, akiheh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />En vawi, mi kiliensah, hinna khu ama ah adihtat sih hi; hinanleh midihtat khu ginnain ahing ding, hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi, tuathamlouin zu a takhiel pouma mi kiliensah ahi a, inn ah a um khinkhian thei sih a, alunggulte gawtmun bangin ahong lien a, Shina bang ahi a, lungkim chi neilou ahi zieh in, namchin ama kungah ahuoi khawm a, mi zousie ama a dingin asiekhawm hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamte zousie in ama demna gentena thu agen ua, tualeh ama elhouna paunah “Ama a hiloupi supung a, khamna sil avum aval a koi a kilalien mi khu atung agih hi, bangtan tuabang in abawl diei?” chiin agen sih ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na sumbate thakhat a hing lungthah, phut lou ding uh amah? Amaute hing khanglou a nang hing, sugenthei lou ding uh amah? Ama ua dinga agallah uh himai ding na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nam tampite na bulutah ziehin, nam na bululou umsunten nangma, ahing bulu ding uhi. Mite sisan na suo zieh leh, gam tung leh khopi sunga tengte, thagum a na pawngbawlnate ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Migilou silbawltheina akipat a, akihundoh theina dinga, tunglam sangtah a abu sep a, a inn a dinga punna dihlou a, huoiham mi atung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tampi thatin na hinna tunga khiel in, na innkuonte tung ah zumna na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Baang akipat suongte a kikoukhe ding ua, singa kibawl innkamten ana dawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sisan suo puma khopi bawl a, thulimlouna toh khopi tungding mi atung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En un, mipite sepgimna meiin akahtum ding leh, namte lung gimna bangmalou a abei ding, galkapte Mangpa deilam ahisih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen tuiin tuipi akhukhum mabangin, Mangpa thupina theina in leitung aluodim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A innvengte kunga dawn ding pie a, asaguohna na et theina dinga akhamsietna ding a, na zu thawl na tul teitei mi tung agih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thupina sangin zumna in na dim zaw hi, Nang zong dawn inlen! Saguoh in umsuh mai ve! Mangpa zietlam khut a nou khu, nangma lam ah ahing kilehei dinga, na thupina tungah zumhuoina, nasatah ahing um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lebanon tunga hiemngapna in, nang ahing khukhum ding a, gamsate sietna in amauh azausah a; Mihing sisan zieh leh gamsung, khopite leh asunga tengte hiemngapna ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Milim bawlthu in bang phattuomna anei a, abawlpa’n ana bawl adiei? Asiemtu in ama khutsuoh ale gintat kia a, Milim ham theilou a bawlpa’n abawl khu, bang ahiei aphattuomna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sing kungah Khanglou in! tualeh suong hamtheilou kung a thou in! Chi mi tung agih hi! Tuakhu in ahil thei mama diei? En vawi, Sana leh dangka tui a kiluon khum ahi bou a, tualeh asungah nahtheina mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa khu abiehinn siengthou ah a um a, leitung pumpi amai ah sip dide in um chiet uhen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shigionoth kai dan a guolnei Habakuk thungetna:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na thugen ka zata a, ka zau hi. Aw Mangpa Kumte lah ah, na nasep suhal inlen, Kumte lah ah kitheisah kia in; Na lungthah chiengin khotuona thei zingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Teman akipat in Pasian ang pei a, Paran muol apat in, Mi Siengthoupa ahing pei hi. Selah Athupina in vante akhu a, tualeh leitung Ama phatna in adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama taanphatdan khu vah bang mai ahi a, akhut apat in ni keng ahing kikapdoh hi, khunah asilbawltheina akiphuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amasang ah natna hipi apei a, khosihpi natna in anua azui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama adingdoh a, leitung ate a, a en a namte akiling sah a, tualeh kumtawn taangte thedal in a um a, kumtawn muolte akun ua alampite kumtawn dai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kushan mite puon inn gentheithuoh in ka mu a, Midian gam puonzahte akithing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Mangpa luite tungah na lungkimsih amah? Na lungthahna luite tungah aum amah? Na sakolte tunga na tuon lai leh, hundamna sakolleng tung a, na tuon laiin, tuipi tungah na lungthahna aum amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mansa diema koi ahita na thalpi, Na thaltang tungah kihahsiel in akichiem uhi; Selah Nang luite in leitung na kikhen sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Taangten nang ang mu ua, akithing uhi. Tuisang lette muol aliemzouta uh. Tuithuh in aw suoin aging vengvunga, akhut tunglam ah avawhsangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na thaltangte vah set sot in aleengkhie ua, na teipite te zolzol in akikhaw ua, Ni leh hapi a umna mun uah, ading den khinkhian uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungthah in leitung na tuonsuoh a, Lungthah pum in namte na tuonchilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na mite hundamna dingin leh, na sathaunupa hundamna dingin, nang kuonkhie hi. Nang migilou innkuonte akipat, lutang na satliem a, ataw akipat alu dong na hawh khiet pieh a, guohtangin na um sahta hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A khote uh lamkaipa, ama chieng ngel in na sun pailet a, Kei thezah dingin pingpei bangin ahing kuon ua, akipahna u khu aguh a migentheite suhmang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang na sakolte toh tuipi ah na vah a, tui kisevum venvon thupitah tawn in na pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka zah in dipkuo in ka chitun a, aw ging in ka muhte atunsah a, ka gute sung ah muotna ahing lut a, Chitun in ka kithing hi, vangsietna ni a ama dou dinga, agalkapte toh ahing kuontou chienga, ka khawldam theina dingin, sip khinkhian in ka ngah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Theipi kung pah sih henlen, grepguite ga sih henlen, Olive sepgimna guohsuohin, tualeh louten neh ding piengsah lou in, ahuong apat ganhonte suhbei a um in, bawngbuhte ah ganta um nawn sih nanleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachiin zong Mangpa ah ka kipah dinga, ka hundamna Pasian ah ka nuom nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian ka hatna ahi a, Aman ka kengte sazuh keng abangsah dinga, tualeh Aman ka muol sangte ah ahing vahsah ding hi. Lapu lien a ding; ka tumging guineite toh sah ding.
  </para>
</usx>
